# Widget / screen work — contract

Before editing here, read @../../.skills/widget-spec.md (build/modify) and
@../../.skills/add-widget.md (composition changes).

- Every widget is self-contained in its own folder: `index.tsx` + `meta.ts` +
  `types.ts` (+ `hooks.ts` for mock data, sub-components as needed).
- New widget = register it in `widgets/_registry.ts` (one line) AND add a preview
  route at `app/preview/<id>/page.tsx`.
- Add a widget to a screen = append a layout cell in `screens/_registry.ts`; pick
  x/y from empty space, default w/h from the widget's meta. Never hand-edit page.tsx.
- Keep `className="num"` on every numeric. Tokens only, no hex. Indian number format.
- Quality bar before "done": side-by-side screenshot matches Figma within ~2px on key
  elements; resizes cleanly min→default→2×; theme toggle leaves no color leaks;
  TypeScript clean, no `any`.
